!modulation control parameters
!parameter_type, bmw_phase_num, bmw_max_period, nCoils, cycles/run, idle/cycle, idle/run, set-up/coil, FFB pause, FFB unpause, post-burst wait/coil
!defaults if absent: 8, 50, 7, 6, 400, 800, 0, 0, 0, 0
!slot = 20+400+20 = 440; cycle = 40+7*440+40+150 = 3310; run = 6*3310+140 = 20000
